# Agent session plans. They are working notes for one task — reasoning, checked-off
# items, a review written at the end — and they are kept locally rather than shared:
# they name internal tickets, and what they conclude belongs in the commit message,
# the changelog and docs/ by the time the work lands. `.claude/tasks/` and
# `.claude/settings.json` stay tracked; those are the project's, not one session's.
.claude/plans/
